<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian 35-day T-bills sell at average 9.790 pct.</title>
<headline>Nigerian 35-day T-bills sell at average 9.790 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian treasury bill sales at weekly auction on Friday as announced by the central bank.</p>
<p>    AUCTION DATE			2nd May	25 April</p>
<p>    TENOR				 35 days	35 days</p>
<p>    AMOUNT SOLD (million naira)   900	    1,720</p>
<p>    BIDS (million naira)	    1,000	  1,820</p>
<p>    WEIGHTED AVERAGE RATE	   9.7900 pct   9.7600 pct</p>
<p>    TRUE YIELD			  9.9435 pct   9.8415 pct</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
